        - identical to `trunc(v * 256) / 256`).
        - """
        - quantizeY(v::Vec2) = Vec2(v.x, trunc(v.y * 256f0) / 256f0)
        - 
        - """A segment with its winding direction (upstream `(Segment, int16)`)."""
        - struct SegW
        -     segment::Segment
        -     winding::Int16
        - end
        - 
        - """
